---
// ApplyFlow.astro — "from application to license" diagram shown above SupporterForm.
// The application is not a contract: it becomes one only after the applicant confirms
// via the email link, pays, and the payment is confirmed. Keep the step texts in sync
// with the license GAS (ApplicationConfirm.js: 48h link / LicenseManager.js: issue after payment).
---

<section class="af-section" aria-labelledby="af-title">
  <div class="af-inner">
    <h2 id="af-title" class="af-title">お申し込みからご利用開始までの流れ</h2>
    <p class="af-lead">
      お申し込みの確定とお支払いは、別の手順です。<strong>お支払いが確認できるまで、ライセンスは発行されません。</strong>
    </p>

    <div class="af-groups">
      <div class="af-group af-group-apply">
        <p class="af-group-label">お申し込み<span class="af-group-note">この段階では契約・課金は発生しません</span></p>
        <ol class="af-steps">
          <li class="af-step">
            <span class="af-num" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
            <div class="af-body">
              <h3 class="af-step-title">フォームを送信</h3>
              <p class="af-step-desc">このページ下の<a href="#sf-form">申込フォーム</a>から送信します。</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="af-step af-step-key">
            <span class="af-num" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
            <div class="af-body">
              <h3 class="af-step-title">確認メールから申込を確定</h3>
              <p class="af-step-desc">届いたメールのリンクを開き「申込を確定する」を押します（<strong>48時間以内</strong>）。届かないときは迷惑メールのフォルダもご確認ください。</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="af-step">
            <span class="af-num" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
            <div class="af-body">
              <h3 class="af-step-title">お支払いのご案内が届く</h3>
              <p class="af-step-desc">銀行振込は見積書・請求書の PDF、Square 決済は決済リンクをメールでお送りします。</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="af-group af-group-pay">
        <p class="af-group-label">お支払い・ライセンス発行</p>
        <ol class="af-steps" start="4">
          <li class="af-step">
            <span class="af-num" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
            <div class="af-body">
              <h3 class="af-step-title">お振込み・お支払い</h3>
              <p class="af-step-desc">請求書の内容でお振込み、または決済リンクからお支払いください。</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="af-step af-step-goal">
            <span class="af-num" aria-hidden="true">5</span>
            <div class="af-body">
              <h3 class="af-step-title">ライセンス発行・ご利用開始</h3>
              <p class="af-step-desc">ご入金の確認後、3営業日以内にライセンスを発行し、領収書の PDF を添えてお知らせします。</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>

    <ul class="af-notes">
      <li>確認メールのリンクを押さないと、お申し込みは確定しません（48時間を過ぎたら、もう一度お申し込みください）。</li>
      <li>見積書・請求書が届いた時点では、まだ契約ではありません。お振込みがなければ、そのままで結構です。</li>
      <li>プレミアム年間サポーターは、90日たってもご入金がない場合に確認のご連絡を1度お送りし、その後お申し込みを取り消します。</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Self-contained styles, `af-` prefixed to avoid collisions with the page. */
  .af-section {
    padding: 60px 5% 0;
    word-break: auto-phrase;
  }

  .af-inner {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .af-title {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: #1B3A6B;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .af-lead {
    text-align: center;
    color: #333333;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
  }

  .af-lead strong {
    color: #B42318;
  }

  .af-groups {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .af-group {
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px 16px 20px;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  /* Arrow between the two groups (step 3 -> step 4) */
  .af-group-apply::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    right: -17px;
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    border-top: 8px solid transparent;
    border-bottom: 8px solid transparent;
    border-left: 11px solid #2E8B2E;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
  }

  .af-group-apply {
    position: relative;
    flex: 3;
    background-color: #EEF3FA;
    border: 2px dashed #9DB2D3;
  }

  .af-group-pay {
    flex: 2;
    background-color: #EDF7ED;
    border: 2px solid #2E8B2E;
  }

  .af-group-label {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1B3A6B;
    font-size: 1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 4px 10px;
  }

  .af-group-pay .af-group-label {
    color: #1F6B1F;
  }

  .af-group-note {
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: #64748b;
  }

  .af-steps {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    gap: 22px;
  }

  .af-step {
    position: relative;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 18px 14px 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Arrow between steps (right on desktop, down on mobile) */
  .af-step:not(:last-child)::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    right: -17px;
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    border-top: 7px solid transparent;
    border-bottom: 7px solid transparent;
    border-left: 10px solid #1B3A6B;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
  }

  .af-num {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: #1B3A6B;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-weight: 900;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .af-step-key .af-num {
    background-color: #D97706;
  }

  .af-step-goal .af-num {
    background-color: #2E8B2E;
  }

  .af-body {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .af-step-title {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #1B3A6B;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .af-step-desc {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    color: #555555;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .af-step-desc a {
    color: #1B3A6B;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .af-step-key {
    outline: 2px solid #F5B85C;
  }

  .af-notes {
    margin: 20px 0 0;
    padding: 14px 18px 14px 34px;
    background-color: #FFFBEB;
    border: 1px solid #FCD34D;
    border-radius: 10px;
    color: #333333;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    list-style: disc;
  }

  .af-notes li + li {
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  /* Tablet: stack the two groups, keep steps in a row */
  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .af-groups {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .af-group-apply::after {
      top: auto;
      bottom: -21px;
      right: auto;
      left: 50%;
      border-left: 8px solid transparent;
      border-right: 8px solid transparent;
      border-top: 11px solid #2E8B2E;
      border-bottom: 0;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
    }
  }

  /* Mobile: vertical timeline */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .af-section {
      padding: 40px 5% 0;
    }
    .af-title {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
    }
    .af-lead {
      text-align: left;
    }
    .af-steps {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .af-step {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: flex-start;
      text-align: left;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .af-num {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .af-step:not(:last-child)::after {
      top: auto;
      bottom: -16px;
      right: auto;
      left: 31px;
      border-left: 7px solid transparent;
      border-right: 7px solid transparent;
      border-top: 10px solid #1B3A6B;
      border-bottom: 0;
      transform: none;
    }
  }
</style>
